@startuml
title PUT /api/v1/review/{id} - Update Review Flow

start

:Client sends PUT /api/v1/review/{id} request;

note right
Optional Query Parameters (or Body Parameters):
- Rating: int
- ReviewText: string
end note

:JWT Authentication Middleware validates access token;

if (JWT token valid?) then (Yes)

    :Request reaches ReviewController;

    :Controller validates parameters;

    if (Validation failed?) then (Yes)
        :Return 400 Bad Request;
        stop
    endif

    :Controller forwards request to Mediator;

    :Mediator sends request to Repository/Handler layer;

    :Handler calls ReviewRepository to retrieve review;

    if (Review exists?) then (Yes)
        if (User is owner?) then (Yes)
            :Handler updates review in ReviewRepository;
            :Map entity to DTO;
            :Return 200 OK;
        else (No)
            :Return 403 Forbidden;
        endif
    else (No)
        :Return 404 Not Found;
    endif

else (No)

    :Return 401 Unauthorized;

endif

stop

@enduml
